cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Seizure Onset (DynaSD)
abstract: Seizure onset time and per-channel onset, recruitment and score from intracranial EEG, with DynaSD
  (neural dynamic divergence; by default LiNDDA, a linear forecaster of each recording's pre-ictal dynamics).
  A step of the Seizure Onset Localisation workflow.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-seizure-dynasd
license: Apache-2.0
